750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) bottom inside the fridge and freezer sections of the refrigeration unit in the kitchen - bottom inside both (food crumbs);
B) spice storage shelf & spice container tray over the microwave (spices/debris);
C) top shelf of prep table against the wall (general buildup);
D) sides of fryers (grease);
E) drip trays of grill and stove (food splash);
F) bottom inside ovens (carbon buildup in left side);   and
G) bottom shelf of prep table holding canned goods in the kitchen (general buildup).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to elimiante buildup of debris.
